{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "8aa9843495adef3623f118f49044f5129c6fa966db61f5d8cd50c8b04a144dca", "ja": "大切だから", "zh": "因为很重视", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c52a995169439fbe55fa0f42591cee84c57c74fed9ab3d35afd1086b5af38187", "ja": "美希のスパイ活動のおかげで、黒井社長の妨\n害計画の全容が明らかになった。また、美希\nは心配してくれた仲間の気持ちを知る。お互\nいに仲間を大切に思っていたことに気付いた\n5人は、その絆を深めるのだった。", "zh": "由于美希进行间谍活动，\n使得黑井社长的妨碍计划东窗事发。\n同时，美希也得知伙伴们多么为自己担心。\n五人发现伙伴对彼此的重视，\n情谊变得更加深厚。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2044105d11bb250d295e2a407877219e1a35992c3fda0d8852837d25e003e670", "ja": "（昴の始球式イベントの数日後、ミルキーウェイの宣伝\nをしたいとケーブルテレビから連絡があった！）", "zh": "（昴的开球活动结束几天后，\n一家有线电视联络我们，想要替『Milky Way』宣传！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_05_1001_p", "source_sha256": "613c4510add6edeb9c1c732d11f03c46c3381fa34e948b79a8ae22cf52eb4204", "ja": "（しかも運よくスケジュールが合い、\nみんなで収録に参加できることになったのだが……）", "zh": "（而且很幸运的，行程刚好有空档，\n因此全员都能参加录影，但是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_05_1002_047sub", "source_sha256": "f3d24a10311845a3afdf41feac9886bf0874b9fcb19eea79c291ded8f458b2a3", "ja": "美希、どうしたんだろう？\n遅いな～。", "zh": "美希是怎么了？\n好慢喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_05_1003_027say", "source_sha256": "b930f468fe83de8f9682c2905a6f2363e2aafe1686bf3022b225bf7ae1e15fe5", "ja": "本当だね。\nもう少しで集合時間だけど……。", "zh": "对啊。\n集合时间就快到了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_05_1004_p", "source_sha256": "d3c06d309e58af2e72aeef56b9872fda470b39c95c1f43d5ecc1d6f5c01cb567", "ja": "（携帯に連絡はなし、か。\nこの間のミーティングではくれたのにな）", "zh": "（手机也没联络吗？\n但上次开会迟到时有传简讯。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_05_1005_027say", "source_sha256": "66a2a0586e5b5dee3d6c9f64a0d9e64875e4d7fcacc9ebe3e50058e9f94de360", "ja": "うーん、今、メールを送ったんだけど、返信がないね。\n本当にどうしたんだろう？", "zh": "唔──我刚刚传了简讯给她，但没有回复。\n到底是怎么了呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_05_1006_p", "source_sha256": "4f379ff6f6d1f861f82b221852df17cb6c521c55cc709ef84c35049743c6defb", "ja": "（返信もない……？\nこれは、やっぱり……黒井社長が絡んでるのか！？）", "zh": "（没有回复……？\n这样果然……跟黑井社长有关吗！？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_05_1007_038chz", "source_sha256": "498701e2fa3065948857b10a4f2f46a2f70b53947dbbdef3e3e583b3febb83a5", "ja": "{$P$}？\n突然、目を丸くして、どうかしたんですの？", "zh": "{$P$}？\n你怎么突然睁大眼睛，怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_05_1008_p", "source_sha256": "cb19125a7c958d271fcd5adf40b08b4892ed0b05850946adc30775052aa113e6", "ja": "いえ、なんでも……ちょっと美希に電話してきます。\nみんなは出発の準備をしていてください！", "zh": "不，没什么……我打电话给美希一下。\n你们先准备出发！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_05_1009_se", "source_sha256": "1bc2ab98f6434b7b2501c94300855b7a403544eff6f07920b58ac8388d1c6288", "ja": "トゥルルルル……トゥルルルル……", "zh": "嘟噜噜噜噜……嘟噜噜噜噜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_05_1010_p", "source_sha256": "ca1d0ef2b3a852ab922f520826ca4b85252c0f7e8bdb440dbbb364d15c5fd450", "ja": "（美希、出てくれ……頼むっ！）", "zh": "（美希，快接啊……求求你！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_05_1011_003mik", "source_sha256": "bdc9d62d748ee8d538f57e28f207826cd59cfa1c9e28daa488ff1b9a26b672dc", "ja": "「あふぅ……。もしもし、ミキだよ。\n{$P$}？」", "zh": "「啊呼……喂，是美希唷。\n是{$P$}吗？」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_05_1012_p", "source_sha256": "c01852741bb71d4588872baeb3ccd68dd9afb5076d47eb8c04e38d5bcbc74892", "ja": "ああ、俺だ。\n美希、今どこにいるんだ？", "zh": "对，是我。\n美希，你现在人在哪里？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_05_1013_003mik", "source_sha256": "3e96767da0c8af1abd854c39df77367031bdd1f084082582b2a4859354366a51", "ja": "「えっと、ミキ、いまね……」", "zh": "「呃，美希，现在……」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_05_1014_se", "source_sha256": "39ec36c454cc37bfe9c76ce9674051d2b77420d78011bad6c022c84573f8d9ba", "ja": "プッ……ツーッ、ツーッ、ツーッ……", "zh": "噗……嘟──嘟──嘟──", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_05_1015_p", "source_sha256": "50eefb721bbd33410711b447800381337d5a6dbc95ef332da9749e01e8098df8", "ja": "……え、美希！？　どうしたんだ、美希！\nくっ、まさか本当に黒井社長が……！？", "zh": "……喂？美希！？你怎么了？美希！\n可恶，难道真的被黑井社长……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_05_1016_031tom", "source_sha256": "9210fad2dd6dc35dd9b9f9f3d660e5fa091b560f1f2baeaea48edacfda39cb40", "ja": "黒井社長が、どうかしたんですか～？", "zh": "黑井社长怎么了吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_05_1017_p", "source_sha256": "2cd0f07daf9f3fa6b42d67dd462aa3b9ea4bad454410e093a66f647174025fa9", "ja": "え……あ、朋花……いや……", "zh": "咦……啊，朋花……没事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_05_1018_031tom", "source_sha256": "175d7bb2ab7469bf4af7e03b392147348586b7934a2371df6660dc4f87e617fb", "ja": "{$P$}さん、この間も美希ちゃんの\n話が出た時、様子がおかしかったですよね～？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，之前大家提到美希时，\n你看起来也不太对劲呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_05_1019_p", "source_sha256": "5867b35d0f11ddf5a2a45651e0683b62483039bd1bb37a6ababcbf2121d26ff4", "ja": "それは……。", "zh": "那是因为……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_05_1020_027say", "source_sha256": "f48aa519232d10eea72c31f5c5a90ba85cf3c52dfaffe6e35ca77d40a8c10658", "ja": "{$P$}、何か知ってるなら\n教えてください！　美希ちゃんは大事な仲間なんです！", "zh": "{$P$}，如果你有头绪的话，\n请告诉我们！美希是我们很重要的伙伴！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_05_1021_031tom", "source_sha256": "fca016711d795ee8daae62f9eedfc22e31d5f2921938ea6524234017a8ab541f", "ja": "嘘は許しませんからね～？\n聖母の目はごまかせませんよ～♪", "zh": "不准说谎喔～\n你瞒不过圣母的眼睛的～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_05_1022_p", "source_sha256": "3faa48d9be84f76233af3206e64a2c06a1aaa255c8056bb4697919abc21b5603", "ja": "……わかった。\n実は……", "zh": "……好吧。\n其实……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_05_1023_027say", "source_sha256": "e921e0cb5c399ddfd7abcac5afd85892ad761cc99d9d953cf19b441b6af5e055", "ja": "美希ちゃんが961プロにスパイ……！？", "zh": "美希要去961艺能当间谍……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_05_1024_031tom", "source_sha256": "4f059fc20de70e204ecc2a3d2be3b307e5eb2c421db18110be025de1eb62e514", "ja": "そんな危ないことをさせるなんて……\nうふふ、ダメプロデューサーですね～。", "zh": "居然让她做这么危险的事情……\n呵呵，真是无能制作人～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_05_1025_p", "source_sha256": "74d66c5419ce5baa2626d860e8ce88d832ba0c472e274acb535bc061be386f69", "ja": "させる気はなかったんだが……\nいや、言い訳だな。俺の監督不行き届きだ。", "zh": "我也不打算让她去……\n不对，这是借口。的确是我监督不周。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_05_1026_047sub", "source_sha256": "37eac1e385a5edb6c34fee846731f9d8bf182c82bf61b558f3a5fb6091169b07", "ja": "ど、どうしよう！\n美希に何かあったら、オレ……！", "zh": "怎、怎么办啊！？\n要是美希出了什么事，我……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_05_1027_p", "source_sha256": "d127d65328934d2634a82e10996654aa05dae48d00147807b872d17a0be02f2b", "ja": "……みんな、少し時間をくれ。", "zh": "……大家，给我一点时间。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_05_1028_031tom", "source_sha256": "ad3502d463fddf817f1076acad0d2761b09fbaa821eeae41a126dbaf2cc7f3fb", "ja": "どうするつもりですか～？", "zh": "你打算怎么做呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_05_1029_p", "source_sha256": "34f0a5ac613481e17c5e346e971f2ef766b02320ea2efc9fbbe0e1bfd5f5e169", "ja": "とにかく、961プロに行ってくるよ。\nでも、安心してほしい。", "zh": "总之，我先过去961艺能看看。\n不过，我希望你们放心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_05_1030_p", "source_sha256": "adaa95996bfd35b7f4a4580577b100532d39710b69860f6a43b512aeadc917b5", "ja": "美希はみんなの仲間で、ミルキーウェイのリーダーで、\nそして765プロのアイドルだ。", "zh": "美希是大家的伙伴、『Milky Way』的队长、\n也是我们765艺能的偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_05_1031_p", "source_sha256": "ab593805b4460a17f0ac116247af3e11235e51f4ca71d4eca99340f13dd8b3e6", "ja": "必ず、取り戻すから。", "zh": "我一定会带她回来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_05_1032_003mik", "source_sha256": "1690ff5581328dcb6acd61681e87cac0430de77343171845eb66b06baf850186", "ja": "なになに？　みんな、ミキの話？", "zh": "怎么了怎么了？大家在聊美希的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_05_1033_p", "source_sha256": "9b0dd9104e88deb373c7550713cb9d6099a7ebf5e4b7069ad63133ef8cfffdd0", "ja": "そう、こんな風にいつも通り……\nうわ、美希じゃないかっ！？", "zh": "没错，带她回来，就能像现在这样一如往常……\n哇！你不是美希吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_05_1034_047sub", "source_sha256": "95d3fe2e82206cba58203d1a34efaf807dde477e0b44e52df58659b2c57196dc", "ja": "無事だったのか！　よかったぁ～。オレ、てっきり\n黒井社長が美希に何かしたのかと思って……。", "zh": "原来你没事啊！？太好了～\n我还以为黑井社长对美希做了什么坏事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_05_1035_003mik", "source_sha256": "c4111f220e905a6d859dd2b2600fd240fdd459bcf126a58f5c0ff244cb0616d7", "ja": "黒井社長が？　何もされてないよ？？", "zh": "黑井社长？他没对美希做任何事啊？？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_05_1036_038chz", "source_sha256": "b8dcfff56532ad4fe2a84370e6a21444679a04f368f8baa0c94870d99d9e0a1f", "ja": "それでは、なぜ{$P$}の電話を\nいきなり切ったのですか？", "zh": "那么你为什么要突然\n挂掉{$P$}的电话呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_05_1037_003mik", "source_sha256": "21d3ec235bff186eee4064dbf9c87409ef6ba8b50049e984d1be5775e8ea33c9", "ja": "電車の中だったから、電波が切れたんだって思うな。\n掛け直そうと思ったんだけど……二度寝しちゃった♪", "zh": "刚刚在搭电车，美希觉得应该是没讯号了呢。\n本来想打回去的……但不小心又睡着了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_05_1038_p", "source_sha256": "7a37ed8331647ba1126736717c2f26a06e93a8768dad43f3913e1408f2e88000", "ja": "に、二度寝……？\nじゃあ、今日の遅刻も……ただ寝坊しただけなのか？", "zh": "又、又睡着了……？\n所以说，今天你会迟到……只是睡过头而已吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_05_1039_003mik", "source_sha256": "33ecc55ca71cc0765f7f2669b02bfaa8a4d085682359bcc24fc521a1cd81c04f", "ja": "そうなの！\nごめんなさい。あはっ☆", "zh": "没错唷！\n对不起，啊哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_05_1040_p", "source_sha256": "fd37d13a5d14981fca25332dc9064ab392d778eb6e622d73ce313055d768c308", "ja": "……まあ、とにかく無事でよかった。\nとりあえず時間がないから、収録に向かうぞ！", "zh": "……算了，没事就好了。\n不管怎样，现在没时间了，快去录影吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_05_1041_null", "source_sha256": "3f942ef322a940f008eb97249baf2b3f531b893cbae87cff0a3d128651e29682", "ja": "収録現場……", "zh": "录影现场……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_05_1042_047sub", "source_sha256": "8eb5c4b83c38181c16ceece299f6de252cd8613381f206d8c7a66294261bc71b", "ja": "えっ！？　じゃあ、黒井社長はCD発売イベントを\n妨害して、ライブまで台なしにする気なのかよ！", "zh": "什么！？所以黑井社长想妨碍CD发片的活动，\n害我们的演唱会泡汤吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_05_1043_003mik", "source_sha256": "dbfcc8b3231503b9e2fe5ccdd9c4363b1d73e67448587a50afdb6b03903f0705", "ja": "うん、喫茶店でそー言ってたよ。", "zh": "嗯，他在咖啡厅是这么说的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_05_1044_p", "source_sha256": "fc0c531b729b60fc8f3b22e335e5e8b39d79f8b0fbdba4fe393f621f691cda35", "ja": "黒井社長、そんなことを……\nていうか美希、スパイはダメって言っただろ？", "zh": "黑井社长居然想做这种事……\n不对啊，美希，我不是叫你不可以当间谍吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_05_1045_003mik", "source_sha256": "44ccb105100cff3d122c68672aa7217cff4b8bb2924fbebfea5a7cae9a2491b5", "ja": "むー。せんにゅー？とかはしてないよ？\n喫茶店でごちそうしてくれるって言うから……。", "zh": "唔～可是人家又没有……潜入？是这么说的吗？\n只是去咖啡厅让他请客而已啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_05_1046_003mik", "source_sha256": "2d805efa8c3ae4239f519808a8abda338fcaad79af62e49e9b76717ff18eb55c", "ja": "でも{$P$}、\nもしかして……怒ってる？", "zh": "可是{$P$}，\n你该不会……生气了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_05_1047_p", "source_sha256": "ed89686431668c3c6ca19045af118b6d147c2a91288a6b70fcde3462e15937d3", "ja": "いや、俺が怒ってるとかじゃなくて……！", "zh": "不是，我没有生气……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_05_1048_031tom", "source_sha256": "8198c767b0e24b84279232e672a64ee2a4ef508fa4ddc0b61c10800a49764c72", "ja": "ともかく、向こうの出方がわかりました～。\nこれで対策が立てられますよ～♪", "zh": "总之，现在知道对方的动向了～\n这样就能拟定对策了～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_05_1049_027say", "source_sha256": "89507f2efc989ae993136d0f39354ee2a58c404bf51af4d857f25e0de7ef01be", "ja": "だけど美希ちゃん。今度から危険なことは\nひとりでやらないでね……私達、仲間なんだから！", "zh": "不过，美希，下次你不可以再独自做危险的事情喔……\n因为我们都是伙伴啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_05_1050_038chz", "source_sha256": "37e384eface5b99903c4bca5bada4248fcc8ecdff2435880e8fdb8bedb2cc29f", "ja": "そうですわ！\nまあ、美希の気持ちもわかりますけど。", "zh": "没错！\n虽然本小姐也是能体会美希的心情啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_05_1051_038chz", "source_sha256": "9f7c8fea999009f9286465d16a23743f813c745aa6320ca1f7b5bdcea9ddf8d4", "ja": "仲間のために、何かしたかったんですわよね。\nわたくし達のために、ありがとう。", "zh": "你想为伙伴做些什么，对吧？\n谢谢你如此为我们着想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_05_1052_003mik", "source_sha256": "43c69745b420980820f6d9bbbdd97a93b96d14ddfc43f75511ce385a4a601cec", "ja": "ううん、ミキの方こそ、ありがとうなの！", "zh": "不对，该道谢的是美希唷！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_05_1053_047sub", "source_sha256": "0b3f02dca97d40923260e6ba812177794332bb1140cf0a02b00a3fdcdb20b3f4", "ja": "えっ、なんで美希がお礼を言うんだ？", "zh": "咦？为什么美希要道谢啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_05_1054_003mik", "source_sha256": "04a273f8553e39b2f44ce15ad9d3c6b9578398d26a5118076a16cb894b7f7ee0", "ja": "だって、ミキのこと、いっぱい心配してくれたから。\nそういうの、すっごくうれしいな。", "zh": "因为大家都很担心美希。\n美希觉得好～开心喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_05_1055_003mik", "source_sha256": "0d887412732d7566c6bba160c477a44287bba3128c7f834f49badedaa0f0db11", "ja": "だから……。\n心配かけて、ごめんなさい。", "zh": "所以……\n对不起，让大家担心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_05_1056_p", "source_sha256": "f2d76e2913870c5ee870076a91ae8c5b6d2a7e8cf90c246a93a0fea056a6c43e", "ja": "（……こんな風に謝られると、叱れないな。\n仲間のためにやったことでもあるし……やれやれ）", "zh": "（……她都这样道歉了，我也骂不下去呢。\n毕竟她是为了伙伴而做的……真是的。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_05_1057_p", "source_sha256": "4d154b618cd324ae5f87ed9eab56ef12e226e44ac24a31bd2991a1477d5208a9", "ja": "……とにかく、そろそろ収録の時間だ。\nミルキーウェイの宣伝、しっかり頼んだぞ！", "zh": "……总之，录影的时间快到了。\n请你们好好宣传『Milky Way』喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_05_1058_p", "source_sha256": "a86ffe8849098975d6098cecdea9335a1402105acdcc19585f200acd28381746", "ja": "……ん？　美希、どうした？", "zh": "……嗯？美希，怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_05_1059_003mik", "source_sha256": "ee7b2372eac8877463cb2e82fabbfaf09aeaece6ded8f5e1fc690e7756ca3d08", "ja": "あのね、さっきミキを取り戻すって\n言ってくれたでしょ？", "zh": "那个啊，刚才你说要带回美希，\n对不对？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_05_1060_003mik", "source_sha256": "1aae298b233e14090649cc3661c0d8f0254edbf97fbefcdd49ed2e45ab42fa81", "ja": "{$P$}、\nすごくカッコよかったよ♪　それだけ……あはっ☆", "zh": "{$P$}，你那样很帅气喔♪\n就这样……啊哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_05_1061_p", "source_sha256": "82abf7da226bd5856ca11eb8156d38f691132d9c711abfa2270f21df58f74c4c", "ja": "（屈託のない笑顔でそう言うと、美希は走っていって\nしまった……相変わらず、色々と目が離せないな）", "zh": "（美希带着爽朗的笑容说完后就跑走了……\n她还是老样子，各方面都令人无法转移视线啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_05_1062_p", "source_sha256": "c967b4c33100ffccba00a5c7e083b2d554c151f83ca6fa32d980dab06e3a998b", "ja": "（さあ、黒井社長には悪いが、メンバーの絆は\nかえって強まった！　もう邪魔はさせないぞ……！）", "zh": "（很好，抱歉啦，黑井社长，\n我们成员的情谊反而更加坚定了！你别想再搅局……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
